# What this repository's own builds, tools and documented workflows write into
# the checkout. One developer's tool state (an agent runtime, an MCP cache, a
# personal scratch directory) goes in .git/info/exclude, which every worktree of
# the clone shares, or in the global excludes file (~/.config/git/ignore unless
# core.excludesFile says otherwise), not here.

# ── Cargo ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The default target directory; a CARGO_TARGET_DIR elsewhere needs no entry.
/target/

# ── Test and profiling output written beside the sources ─────────────────────
# insta leaves `<name>.snap.new` next to a mismatched snapshot
# (.config/insta.yaml sets `update: new`) and `.pending-snap` for an inline
# one; `cargo insta review` accepts or rejects them.
*.snap.new
*.pending-snap
# `-C instrument-coverage`, `cargo llvm-cov --lcov`, perf and cargo flamegraph
# write into the directory they run in.
*.profraw
*.profdata
lcov.info
perf.data*
flamegraph.svg

# ── Build output outside target/ ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# mdBook (`mdbook build book/`; .github/workflows/docs.yml deploys it).
/book/book/
# wasm-pack or wasm-bindgen output of the web examples (examples/README.md).
/examples/*/pkg/
# Bytecode of the Python drivers under tools/.
__pycache__/
# The repository root is not a FLUI app: `flui create` and `flui build` write
# platforms/ inside an app, so one here was scaffolded in the wrong directory.
/platforms/

# ── Reference clones and agent working files (AGENTS.md) ─────────────────────
# Optional read-only clones of Flutter and GPUI.
/.flutter/
/.gpui/
# The checklist of a long agent run, kept at the worktree root.
/TASKS.md
# Claude Code, the runtime CLAUDE.md is written for, keeps per-user settings
# and whole worktree checkouts under .claude/.
.claude/

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing in the build reads these. The entries keep a stray credential out of
# a public repository; `git add -f` still adds a deliberate test fixture.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
key.properties

# ── Editor and OS files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The ones contributors here produce most; anything rarer belongs in the
# global excludes file.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
